# Loaded by `next dev` only.
#
# The documentation is rendered by this site at /docs/ from
# corevalley-docs/docs/*.md, so no docs variable is needed for local work.
#
# To preview links against the future docs host instead (docs.corevalley.ai,
# see doc_cname_readme.txt) or a local MkDocs server, set it for one run:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_DOCS_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8001 npm run dev   # with `npm run docs:mkdocs:serve`
# With the variable set, the in-app /docs/ pages redirect to that host.
